  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in one compact deterministic specification. The specification gives exactly one controllable action in each explore/recovery state, keeps all obstacle-reached states turn-only, uses random_walk as the default clear exploration action, inserts a short forward pulse after a successful random walk for coverage, and returns quickly to exploration when path_clear is observed. Action states self-loop on path_clear so intended open-loop pulses are not preempted, while obstacle events can still force safe recovery.",
